  "body": "Workholding now lives under Fixtures in every state; the Setups page no longer carries the workholding block or the tool list.\n\n## What changed\n- Setups page, no setups: the workholding block and the tool list are removed; the page keeps \"Create first setup\", one pointer line to the browser's Fixtures and Tool list nodes, and the export row.\n- Setup<n> Settings page: an \"Open <name> fixtures\" button on the Delete line (no new row, so `setup_page_alignment_rows_structure` is unchanged).\n- Implicit setup Settings page (no setups): a pointer line only.\n- Decision note: `docs/decisions/1197-workholding-under-fixtures.md`.\n- Test change on top of ab7597f4: the one-setup test now uses a 1280x1400 pane and clicks \"Open Setup1 fixtures\" instead of only asserting it exists.\n\n## Pinning tests\n- `tests::setups_declutter::a_document_without_setups_keeps_workholding_under_fixtures_only`\n- `tests::setups_declutter::one_setup_keeps_workholding_under_its_fixtures_page`\n- Existing `the_setups_page_lists_setups_only_and_each_setup_page_keeps_its_settings` covers the several-setups state.\n\n## Gate\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main` on head 3b92beeb: green on the first run (ui lib unit tests, boundary, boundary_picks, theme_files; 4.0 min).\n\n## Escalation history\nThe medium worker's branch (ab7597f4) failed its quick gate twice and was escalated. This PR continues that branch.\n\n## Not exercised\n- Nothing was looked at on screen; layout is checked by the harness only.\n- The Setup<n> button placement is tested at 1280x1400 only.\n\nChangelog: fix(ui): workholding lives under Fixtures in every state; the Setups page no longer shows it (#1197)\n\nEffort: high\n\nFixes #1197\n",
